    "plain_text": "J. Paul Getty was an American oil industrialist, investor and art collector who built one of the twentieth century’s largest private fortunes. He expanded inherited petroleum interests through exploration, acquisitions and an exceptionally valuable Middle Eastern concession. His collection and estate endowed the museum and trust that made his name central to global arts philanthropy.",
